  "metadata": {
    "instant": true,
    "version": 1,
    "scenario": {
      "roundtrips": 1,
      "maxErrors": 3,
      "autoCommit": true,
      "autoCommitTriggerLast": true,
      "sequential": false,
      "slots": null,
      "confidential": false,
      "dataloss": false,
      "dlq": false,
      "freshVariables": false
    },
    "designer": {
      "orphans": []
    },
    "zone": "us1.make.com"
  },
  "notes": [
    {
      "id": "note1",
      "text": "CONFIGURATION REQUIRED:\n\n1. Replace {{YOUR_GOHIGHLEVEL_API_KEY}} with your actual GoHighLevel API key in modules 4 and 6\n\n2. Configure Shopify webhook:\n   - Go to Shopify Admin > Settings > Notifications > Webhooks\n   - Create webhook for 'Customer creation' or 'Customer update'\n   - Set webhook URL to the Make.com webhook URL from module 1\n   - Add webhook authentication if required\n\n3. Test the scenario:\n   - Use 'Run once' to generate the webhook URL\n   - Send a test webhook from Shopify or use Make.com's webhook tester\n   - Verify contact creation in GoHighLevel\n   - Check WhatsApp message delivery\n\n4. Customize the WhatsApp message template in module 6 to match your brand voice\n\n5. Adjust error handling in module 7 as needed (e.g., send to Google Sheets, email notification, etc.)",
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 300,
          "width": 600,
          "height": 400
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note2",
      "text": "DATA FLOW:\n\n1. Shopify webhook triggers when lead is approved\n2. Data is extracted and stored in variables\n3. HTTP request creates/updates contact in GoHighLevel\n4. Contact ID is extracted from response\n5. WhatsApp message is sent via GoHighLevel\n6. Error handling logs any failures",
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": -300,
          "width": 400,
          "height": 200
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
